INSERT INTO sessions VALUES('3b87ff58-0ba','/home/iconbaypark2900/openworker-workspace/opensciencelab','ollama:qwen3.8-27b:latest','auto','Task: Run the Phase-3 exit gate for opensciencelab/ and clos','builder',230,NULL,'[]',0,0,NULL,NULL,'Phase 3 Exit Gate Closure',0,'2026-08-26 12:07:49','{}','{"boundary_index": 160, "summary_text": "**Primary request and intent**\n\nRun the **Phase-3 exit gate** for `~/openworker-workspace/opensciencelab` (branch `phase2-drug-and-materials`) and **close Phase 3**. Phase 3 coding (descriptors, Vina adapter, PySCF DFT, CHGNet) is complete; this is **verification and closure only** \u2014 no new adapters.\n\nThe user defined 6 ordered steps (Step 0 \u2192 Step 5), with **two \u2696\ufe0f decision points** (Step 4: choose drug target + materials front; Step 5: sign-off) where the assistant must **stop and ask before proceeding**.\n\n**Standing constraints (outlive the turns they were stated in):**\n- **No new repo dependencies** beyond the existing optional imports.\n- **`top_n` gate stays the cost boundary** (roadmap line :168).\n- **`ledger / base.py / preflight / manifest` are off-limits** unless a root cause genuinely lives there.\n- **Adapter tier honesty (commit 8ae4493) unchanged.**\n- **Seed 1337 pins preserved.**\n- **Never weaken the stamp to make a test pass** \u2014 fix at the adapter/contract boundary.\n- **Stop only at \u2696\ufe0f decision points**; all other steps execute in order.\n- A row stamped `real` whose adapter never actually fired is a **FAIL** even if the number looks plausible.\n- Only \"real\" rows count toward evidence for closure.\n\n**Key concepts and decisions**\n\n- **Step 1 (build infra) completed this session.** The Dockerfile had multiple pin/incompatibility issues that were iteratively fixed:\n  - `pymatgen` bumped `2024.8.9` \u2192 `2024.9.10` (chgnet 0.4.2 requires `>=2024.9.10`).\n  - `curl` added to apt layer (slim image lacked it; needed for vina binary download).\n  - `make_receptor.py` call in Dockerfile fixed: now passes SMILES and dest args explicitly (was dead-arg bug).\n  - `meeko` bumped `0.5.0` \u2192 `0.7.1` (0.5.0 imports `rdkit.six`, removed in rdkit 2024.3.5+; host proved 0.7.1 + rdkit 2026.3.5 works).\n  - `gemmi==0.7.5` added (meeko 0.7.1 hard-depends on it; host version matched).\n  - Final rebuild (bg-5) **succeeded**: vina 1.2.5 binary present, receptor 22 atoms written to `data/receptor.pdbqt`, all 12 layers clean.\n- **All fixes are build-infrastructure**, not adapter/contract changes (off-limits files untouched).\n- **Step 3 prep (kill-criteria tests):** The assistant read the full stamp/resolution seam map:\n  - `drugdiscovery.py`: `dft_objective()` returns `(value_fn, method_fn)`; `resolve(cand)` returns `(value, stamp, tier)` from ONE resolution call. Surrogate `_gap_surrogate` is a simple SMILES heuristic (heavy atoms, HBD count).\n  - `materials.py`: `e_form_objective(chgnet_fn)` same pattern; surrogate uses `EN_TABLE` lookup.\n  - `dft.py`: `DFTAdapter` with `top_n` per-instance counter, `admit()`, `_run_rks()` (PySCF RKS, returns dict with `gap_ev` key).\n  - `chgnet.py`: `ChgNetAdapter` with `top_n` per-instance counter, `_run_chgnet(structure, cfg)` (CHGNet E_form inference).\n  - Existing tests at lines ~1886\u20131960 (DFT top-N gate bound), ~2110\u20132159 (mixed-run billing), ~2159+ (chgnet stamp/ceiling).\n  - The two kill-criteria invariants to pin: **(a) stamp-honesty** \u2014 a `ScoreVector` stamped `real` must carry a value from the declared backend''s real path (value \u2261 real backend output AND \u2260 surrogate); **(b) top-N ceiling** \u2014 `DFTAdapter.top_n` / `ChgNetAdapter.top_n` hold across `make_drug_evaluator()` + `drug_evolve()` / `make_materials_evaluator()` + search \u2014 one adapter instance, one counter, no re-admission after exhaustion.\n- **Roadmap:** `~/openworker-workspace/openevolve_roadmap.md` defines the 5-section report structure and the top-N cost-boundary rule at line :168.\n- **Brain recall:** Thread `openevolve-phase-2` (active) \u2014 Phase 2 steps 1\u20132 done; Phase-3 Vina adapter slot was the remaining item.\n\n**Artifacts and files**\n\n| Path | Role | Status |\n|---|---|---|\n| `~/openworker-workspace/opensciencelab/` | Repo root, branch `phase2-drug-and-materials` | Working |\n| `Dockerfile` (repo root) | 12-layer build for `opensciencelab:verify`; installs torch CPU, rdkit, meeko, pyscf, chgnet, pymatgen, gemmi, vina binary | **Modified** (pymatgen 2024.9.10, meeko 0.7.1, gemmi 0.7.5, curl, make_receptor args) \u2014 **uncommitted** |\n| `pyproject.toml` | `[verify]` extra mirrors Dockerfile pins | **Modified** (pymatgen, meeko, gemmi) \u2014 **uncommitted** |\n| `scripts/make_receptor.py` | Placeholder receptor generator (SMILES\u2192PDBQT) | **Modified** (accepts `smi` and `dest` args) \u2014 **uncommitted** |\n| `opensciencelab/tests.py` (~2318 + new lines) | 97-test suite + Phase 3 contract tests + **two new kill-criteria tests** | **Modified** (kill-criteria tests appended) \u2014 **uncommitted**, **not yet run** |\n| `opensciencelab/drugdiscovery.py` (409 lines) | DFT + docking objectives; `dft_objective()`, `docking_objective()`, `resolve()` seam, `_gap_surrogate`, `_docking_surrogate` | Read (118\u2013312) for Step 3 prep |\n| `opensciencelab/materials.py` (537 lines) | CHGNet objective; `e_form_objective()`, EN_TABLE surrogate | Read (91\u2013232) for Step 3 prep |\n| `opensciencelab/dft.py` (410 lines) | PySCF tier-2 DFT adapter; `DFTAdapter`, `top_n`, `admit()`, `_run_rks()`, `_conformer_for()` | Read (160\u2013340) for Step 3 prep |\n| `opensciencelab/chgnet.py` (549 lines) | CHGNet E_form adapter; `ChgNetAdapter`, `top_n`, `_run_chgnet()`, `EN_TABLE` | Read (228\u2013420) for Step 3 prep |\n| `opensciencelab/docking.py` | Vina adapter; header parser fix (real 1.2.x + fixture) | **Committed** earlier |\n| `scripts/live_verify.py` (410 lines) | G1\u2013G4 live-kernel verification; charged at declared tier | **Committed** |\n| `PHASE3.md` | Phase 3 status/report | **Committed**; needs Step 2 restructure |\n| `docker/docker-run.sh` | Helper to run verify image | **Committed** |\n| `docker/vina.sha256` | Pinned vina binary checksum | **Committed** |\n| `~/openworker-workspace/openevolve_roadmap.md` | Roadmap; 5-section structure + top-N cost boundary (:168) | Read (grep) |\n| `runs/` | Execution artifacts (gitignored) | Local only |\n\n**Errors and fixes**\n\n1. **pip resolution failure \u2014 `pymatgen` version conflict:** `chgnet==0.4.2` requires `pymatgen>=2024.9.10`; Dockerfile pinned `2024.8.9`. **Fix:** Bumped to `2024.9.10` in both `Dockerfile` and `pyproject.toml`.\n\n2. **Missing `curl` in `python:3.11-slim`:** Vina binary download needs `curl`. **Fix:** Added `curl` to apt-get install line.\n\n3. **`make_receptor.py` dead-arg bug:** Script ignored CLI args (always used default SMILES and wrote to `/tmp`). **Fix:** Added `smi` and `dest` optional args. Dockerfile call updated to pass both explicitly.\n\n4. **meeko 0.5.0 / rdkit 2024.3.5 incompatibility:** meeko 0.5.0 imports `rdkit.six`, which rdkit 2024.3.5 no longer ships. **Fix:** Bumped meeko to `0.7.1` (matching host''s working pair of rdkit 2026.3.5 + meeko 0.7.1).\n\n5. **Missing `gemmi` for meeko 0.7.1:** meeko 0.7.1 hard-depends on `gemmi`. **Fix:** Added `gemmi==0.7.5` (pinned to host version) to both Dockerfile and pyproject.toml.\n\n6. **First kill-criteria test attempt had multiple errors:** Dead code, wrong mock approach for chgnet (tried to monkey-patch `_mock_chgnet` class that didn''t exist as mockable), wrong assertion on DFT value, used `preflight()`/`evolve()` names that don''t exist (actual names are `make_drug_evaluator()`/`drug_evolve()` and `make_materials_evaluator()`). **Fix:** Deleted the first attempt (Python script truncated tests.py at the marker comment), investigated actual API signatures via `inspect.signature`, verified element types in `EN_TABLE`, then wrote a corrected second version.\n\n**All user messages**\n\n*(No user messages appeared in the new turns since the previous compaction. The entire new conversation is assistant-driven execution of Steps 1 and 3. The user''s original instructions and constraints are captured in the previous compaction summary.)*\n\n**Pending tasks**\n\n- **Run the two new kill-criteria tests** (`test_stamp_honesty_real_value_m", "working_state": "## Working state (extracted mechanically from tool records)\nRecent shell commands:\n- cd ~/openworker-workspace/opensciencelab && python3 - <<''EOF'' import inspect import opensciencelab.drugdiscovery as d import opensciencelab.materials as m impor  [ok]\n- cd ~/openworker-workspace/opensciencelab && sed -n ''154,186p'' opensciencelab/drugdiscovery.py && echo \"=== chgnet adapter score/evaluate tail ===\" && sed -n ''37  [ok]\n- cd ~/openworker-workspace/opensciencelab && sed -n ''2110,2155p'' opensciencelab/tests.py && grep -n \"def _build_structure\" -A 6 opensciencelab/chgnet.py  [ok]\n- cd ~/openworker-workspace/opensciencelab && python3 - <<''EOF'' import re path = \"opensciencelab/tests.py\" src = open(path).read() # Find the kill-criteria commen  [ok]\n- cd ~/openworker-workspace/opensciencelab && wc -l opensciencelab/tests.py && echo \"=== tail ===\" && tail -8 opensciencelab/tests.py  [ok]\n- cd ~/openworker-workspace/opensciencelab && python3 - <<''EOF'' import opensciencelab.chgnet as c, opensciencelab.materials as m, opensciencelab.dft as d print(\"E  [exit 1]\n- cd ~/openworker-workspace/opensciencelab && python3 - <<''EOF'' import opensciencelab.materials as m els = [\"K\",\"F\",\"Na\",\"Cl\",\"Li\",\"Zn\",\"O\",\"Cd\",\"Te\",\"Mg\",\"S\",\"Ga  [ok]\n- cd ~/openworker-workspace/opensciencelab && python3 - <<''PYEOF'' import inspect import opensciencelab.dft as d # What does _run_rks return? Check the function si  [ok]\n- cd ~/openworker-workspace/opensciencelab && grep -n \"_run_chgnet\\|e_form_per_fu\" opensciencelab/chgnet.py | head -10 && echo \"=== _run_chgnet body (start) ===\"   [ok]\n- cd ~/openworker-workspace/opensciencelab && cat >> opensciencelab/tests.py << ''EOF'' # --------------------------------------------------------------------------  [ok]\nTools used in the summarized span: read_file, replace_in_file, run_shell, shell_task_output", "user_messages": ["Task: Run the Phase-3 exit gate for opensciencelab/ and close Phase 3 Repo: ~/openworker-workspace/opensciencelab, branch phase2-drug-and-materials. Phase 3 coding (items 1\u20134: descriptors, Vina adapter, PySCF DFT, CHGNet) is complete \u2014 local ref tip 6f71a30, 97 tests green as of 2026-08-25. Do not build new adapters. This is verification and closure only. Execute in this order, stopping only at the decision points marked \u2696\ufe0f: Step 0 \u2014 Repo hygiene (5 min) Run git status / git log --oneline -14. Items 3 (dft.py) and 4 (chgnet.py) may still be uncommitted on disk. If the working tree is dirty, c\u2026"], "user_messages_dropped": 0, "created_at": 1787703522.3168528, "model_used": "ollama:qwen3.8-27b:latest", "trimmed": false}');
