t-brief-2026-08-26.md: \"Pre-Open Market Brief \u2014 Sigma System \u2014 2026-08-26 (Tue). Staged sources: status_report\u2026\"\n\nFrom outside-view-2026-08-26.md: \"Outside View \u2014 argue against the current approach. Date: 2026-08-26 \u00b7 Run: mid-we\u2026\"\n\nFrom morning-briefing-2026-08-26.md was at top of ls.\n\nPrior stored findings (from ingest_kb.json results, 08-26 run \u2014 25 stores):\n- ROCR AsyncEventsLoop busy-spin gfx1201 (on, breakage)\n- Ollama 0.33.0-RC2 local model toggle (on, news)\n- Iran sanctions announcement scheduled (adjacent, news)\n- liaison-agentSystem stalled 7 days (adjacent, repo)\n- (more, truncated)\n\nAlso referenced:\n- \"Operation Economic Outcast\"\n- \"Anthropic Fellows Program closed-pending\"\n- \"Up to 200,000 mass revocation\"\n\nLedgers:\n- ledger-2026-08-24.md (first run, 12 find/5 store)\n- ledger-2026-08-26.md (25 store limit, 8 successful finds \u2014 MCP find bridge degraded, \"Error calling tool ''qdrant-find'': ''document''\")\n\nMemory:\n- brain_recall thread \"automation-fleet\" \"The scheduled fleet and its knowledge base\" \u2014 \"KB ingest daily job now on its second ledgered run (2026-08-26); knowledge base at 58 points per live API check.\"\n\nNow let me think about the current state. The conversation ends with:\n\"[assistant \u2192 write_file] {\"path\": \"/home/iconbaypark2900/openworker-tasks/__task__task-ecad448aa3/ingest_kb.py\", ...}\"\n\"[assistant] This is a critical situation... Let me write the ingest script.\"\n\"[tool result] ingest_kb.py\"\n\nSo the script was written. The next step would be to run it. But wait \u2014 I need to re-read. The last few turns:\n\n1. Read ledger-2026-08-26.md\n2. write_file ingest_kb.py (with content \"#!/usr/bin/env python3 ... KB ingest 2026-08-27...\")\n3. Assistant explains the critical situation and says \"Let me write the ingest script.\" \u2014 but this came BEFORE the write_file actually? No.\n\nWait, let me re-read the order:\n\n```\n[assistant \u2