odo_write tool spurious keyword errors in some cases\n3. write_file with `todos` kwarg \u2192 error (wrong tool)\n4. `files.<locals>.write_file() got an unexpected keyword argument ''todos''`\n5. Tool \"shell\" unknown (should use run_shell)\n6. File tools can''t access /tmp paths (escape workspace)\n\n**Deliverables (Tier B):**\n- npm test green with new coverage for each protocol validator\n- conformance <good> \u2192 0\n- conformance <bad> \u2192 1\n- older-draft pin flagging drift on good\n- pinned draft version + live spec URLs recorded in harness output\n- Gate must reject a drifted/bad artifact\n\n**Protocol URLs confirmed:**\n- A2A: `https://a2a-protocol.org/v0.3.0/specification/` (200, pinned), older `v0.2.6/specification/` (200), live draft 0.4.0-dev 404, live fetch uses `latest` pointer\n- AP2: `https://ap2-protocol.org/ap2/specification/` (200)\n- UCP: `https://ucp.dev/2026-04-08/specification/overview/` (200)\n- Web Bot Auth: key directory, signature directory\n\n**Architecture decided:**\n- Model: required = pinned fields always. The `pin` flag selects drift reference edition (older/pinned/live).\n- Pinning to pinned \u2192 pass; bad vs pinned \u2192 fail (missing); pinned vs older \u2192 drift; any vs live \u2192 pass.\n- Live edition configurable; live fetch = reachability + edition-confirm step.\n\n**Field set details:**\n- AP2 mandate: older: `[''user'', ''agent'', ''shoppingIntent'', ''ttl'']`, pinned: `[''user'', ''agent'', ''shoppingIntent'', ''ttl'']`, live: `[''user'', ''merchant'', ''shoppingIntent'', ''ttl'']`. renamed: agent \u2192 merchant (pinned\u2192live rename). Pinned uses `agent`, live uses `merchant`.\n- A2A capabilities: older: `[''agentExtensions'', ''messageTypes'']`, pinned: `[''agentExtensions'', ''messageTypes'', ''pushNotificationConfig'']`, live: `[''agentExtensions'', ''messageTypes'', ''pushNotificationConfig'', ...]`. Removed stray `map` from older set.\n\n**Invariants:**\n- `older \u2286 pinned \u2286 live` (up to rename