ble under system python by inserting `agpack/src` on `sys.path`.\n- **Closed audit KINDS set** (4 records exactly): `dispatch`, `import_call`, `delegate`, `budget`.\n- **ERC-4626 attribution-by-share**: `total_assets \u00d7 shares / totalShares`. Because price-per-share is a **constant** (`PRICE_PER_SHARE = 1_000_000_000` = 1e8 wei/share), `total_assets` is divisible by `total_shares` \u2192 attribution is **exact, zero remainder** (no remainder-scatter scheme needed). `sum == delta` invariant holds to the wei.\n- **replay() must self-validate** and raise `LedgerCorrupt` on any corruption (the JSONL written must round-trip through the real contract).\n- **Redaction rule**: only `args_sha256_prefix16` is redacted.\n\n## 3. Artifacts and files\n\n- **`P2_TASK.md`** (workspace root) \u2014 the Phase 0 prompt; read in full. Source of all \u00a70\u2013\u00a79 requirements.\n- **`concord/runtime.py`** (NEW, created) \u2014 Phase 0 settlement runtime; smoke-tested green. Key facts:\n  - `CHAIN_NAMES` tuple (sorted): `(\"aave\", \"compound\", \"lido\", \"yearn\", \"curve\")`.\n  - **140 partners / 5 chains**.\n  - `PRICE_PER_SHARE: int = 1_000_000_000` (constant; makes attribution exact).\n  - Exports: `build_corpus()` returning object with `.chains` and `.partners`, plus `build_audit_jsonl` / read / `reconcile` path. Uses real `agpack.trust.audit` (`LedgerCorrupt`, `replay`).\n  - Produces **286 records**: `budget`\u00d71, `dispatch`\u00d75, `delegate`\u00d7140, `import_call`\u00d7140.\n  - NOTE: was edited via shell heredocs (see Errors); the `PRICE_PER_SHARE` line and docstring were corrupted then restored. **Re-read `concord/runtime.py` before relying on its content** (lines ~84\u201387 were the fragile zone).\n- **`concord/__main__.py`** (replaced via `write_file`, in progress) \u2014 new command surface: keeps `check` byte-identical; adds `build`, `verify invariant`, `verify audit`, `verify reconcile`.", "working_state": "## Working state (extracted mechanically from 